### ==============================================================================
### Micro-Redis API Request Collection (REST Client / Thunder Client)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/cache

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1

### 2. Metrics & Hit/Miss Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics HTTP/1.1

### 3. Set Cache (String with TTL)
POST {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "user:session:1001",
  "value": {
    "userId": 1001,
    "username": "johndoe",
    "email": "johndoe@company.local",
    "roles": ["admin", "editor"]
  },
  "ttl": 3600,
  "type": "string"
}

### 4. Get Cache by Key
GET {{baseUrl}}/user:session:1001 HTTP/1.1

### 5. Set Cache (Hash Structure)
POST {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "user:profile:1001",
  "value": {
    "name": "John Doe",
    "department": "Engineering",
    "tier": "enterprise"
  },
  "ttl": 7200,
  "type": "hash"
}

### 6. Get Hash by Key
GET {{baseUrl}}/user:profile:1001 HTTP/1.1

### 7. Atomic Increment / Rate Limiting
POST {{baseUrl}}/increment HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "ratelimit:ip:192.168.1.50",
  "amount": 1,
  "ttl": 60
}

### 8. List - Push Item (Queue)
POST {{baseUrl}}/list/push HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "queue:notifications",
  "values": [
    { "type": "EMAIL", "recipient": "user@example.com", "payload": "Welcome!" },
    { "type": "SLACK", "channel": "#alerts", "payload": "System online" }
  ],
  "direction": "right"
}

### 9. List - Get Items (Range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/queue:notifications?start=0&stop=-1 HTTP/1.1

### 10. List - Pop Item (Worker consuming queue)
POST {{baseUrl}}/list/pop HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "queue:notifications",
  "direction": "left"
}

### 11. Set - Add Members (Tags / Unique IDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/set/add HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "tags:article:42",
  "members": ["redis", "microservices", "nodejs", "high-availability"]
}

### 12. Set - Get All Members
GET {{baseUrl}}/set/tags:article:42 HTTP/1.1

### 13. Set - Check Membership
POST {{baseUrl}}/set/ismember HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "tags:article:42",
  "member": "high-availability"
}

### 14. Sorted Set - Add Leaderboard / Ranked Items
POST {{baseUrl}}/zset/add HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "leaderboard:weekly",
  "entries": [
    { "member": "PlayerAlpha", "score": 9500 },
    { "member": "PlayerBeta", "score": 12800 },
    { "member": "PlayerGamma", "score": 8200 }
  ]
}

### 15. Sorted Set - Get Top Ranked (Descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/zset/leaderboard:weekly?reverse=true&start=0&stop=-1 HTTP/1.1

### 16. Stream - Add Event Entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/stream/add HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "events:audit:log",
  "data": {
    "action": "CONFIG_UPDATE",
    "actor": "admin_johndoe",
    "ip": "10.0.0.1",
    "timestamp": "2026-09-30T08:00:00Z"
  }
}

### 17. Stream - Read Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/stream/events:audit:log?count=10 HTTP/1.1

### 18. Purge Keys by Pattern
POST {{baseUrl}}/purge HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pattern": "user:*"
}

### 19. Delete Specific Key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/user:session:1001 HTTP/1.1
